


>> Deck := Mndandanda chatsopano.
Deck chikafika: ['print'] chitani: {
        >> len := wekha chiwerengero-cha-zinthu - 1.
        { :i
                >> len2 := wekha chiwerengero-cha-zinthu - 1.
                Zotuluka lembani: ['len: '].
                Zotuluka lembani: len, mzere-watsopano.
                Zotuluka lembani: ['len2: '].
                Zotuluka lembani: len2, mzere-watsopano.
        } × len.
}.

>> d := Deck ← 1 ; 4 ; 9 ; 16 ; 25 ; 36 ; 49 ; 64 ; 81.
d print.
